atalia\",\"heroName\":\"Natalia\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Heroes with gap closers or high burst like Hayabusa, Natalia, and Hanzo.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"hanzo\",\"heroName\":\"Hanzo\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Heroes with gap closers or high burst like Hayabusa, Natalia, and Hanzo.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_cdd151e2293c14b2abc3c1c8e57d4392.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_24837021ec9d7aaf41b13fa55b6d13c9.png\",\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Primal Force\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Valentina gains 8-50 extra EXP (scales with level) each time she deals damage to an enemy hero. Cooldown: 2s.\\nIf the enemy hero's level is not higher than hers, 30% of the damage dealt is converted into her HP.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Valentina gains 8-50 extra EXP (scales with level) each time she deals damage to an enemy hero. Cooldown: 2s.\\nIf the enemy hero's level is not higher than hers, 30% of the damage dealt is converted into her HP.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f2707973fdd30d201d53b1ff21d1a6c7.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\",\"Heal\"]},{\"name\":\"Shadow Strike\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Valentina casts Shadow Strike in the target direction, dealing 475 (+145% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies hit and slowing them by 40% for 1s.\\nEnemy heroes hit are marked with a Shadow Sigil for 4s. Marked enemies hit by Shadow Strike again are Terrified for 1s (a target can only be terrified once every 4s).\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Valentina casts \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Shadow Strike\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" in the target direction, dealing 475\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+145% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to enemies hit and slowing them by 40% for 1s.\\nEnemy heroes hit are marked with a \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Shadow Sigil\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" for 4s. Marked enemies hit by \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Shadow Strike\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" again are \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Terrified\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" for 1s (a target can only be terrified once every 4s).\"}],\"cooldown\":\"7s\",\"manaCost\":\"70\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b94bb62631a5dafb525050bffb68de7e.png\",\"tags\":[\"Damage\",\"CC\"]},{\"name\":\"Arcane Shade\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Valentina dashes in the target direction, firing 3 Shadow Bolts at nearby enemies that deal 90 (+30% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage each. She can cast this skill again within 6s (costs Mana).\\n\\nEach time a Shadow Bolt hits an enemy, the cooldown of Shadow Strike is reduced by 1s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Valentina dashes in the target direction, firing 3 Shadow Bolts at nearby enemies that deal 90\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+30% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage each. She can cast this skill again within 6s (costs Mana).\\n\\nEach time a Shadow Bolt hits an enemy, the cooldown of \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Shadow Strike\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" is reduced by 1s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"12s\",\"manaCost\":\"40\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_69e8d02ef8e1ae83895754e670f63e2e.png\",\"tags\":[\"Mobility\",\"Buff\"]},{\"name\":\"I Am You\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Valentina slows the target enemy hero by 70% for 0.5s and gains the ability to cast their Ultimate. Casting the enemy's Ultimate turns her into the enemy hero's form and inherits their Basic Attack type for up to 12s (her regular skills remain unchanged unless the enemy's Ultimate has a Morph effect).\\nThe stolen Ultimate's level equals Valentina's own Ultimate level, and its cooldown is 120% of the target's (but no lower than 10s).\\nIf the target is a Physical Damage hero, Valentina gains (+100% Total Magic Power) Physical Attack for the duration. This cannot be used on an enemy Valentina.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Valentina slows the target enemy hero by 70% for 0.5s and gains the ability to cast their \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Ultimate\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\". Casting the enemy's \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Ultimate\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" turns her into the enemy hero's form and inherits their Basic Attack type for up to 12s (her regular skills remain unchanged unless the enemy's \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Ultimate\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" has a \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Morph\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" effect).\\nThe stolen \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Ultimate\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"'s level equals Valentina's own \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Ultimate\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" level, and its cooldown is 120% of the target's (but no lower than 10s).\\nIf the target is a Physical Damage hero, Valentina gains \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+100% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Attack\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" for the duration. This cannot be used on an enemy Valentina.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"55s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ee7ae2c3b2074399fa3cdb5e5271630e.png\",\"tags\":[\"Morph\",\"Slow\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-1-2\"},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"carmilla\",\"heroName\":\"Carmilla\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Heroes that can buff or CC such as Carmilla and Atlas to give her more opportunities to deal damage.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"atlas\",\"heroName\":\"Atlas\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Heroes that can buff or CC such as Carmilla and Atlas to give her more opportunities to deal damage.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"Copy an Ultimate or use 2nd Skill for better positioning. Use 1st Skill and reset its cooldown with 2nd Skill, then Terrify the target and use her copied Ultimate to secure the kill.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":11030,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ee7ae2c3b2074399fa3cdb5e5271630e.png\"},{\"skillId\":11020,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_69e8d02ef8e1ae83895754e670f63e2e.png\"},{\"skillId\":11010,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b94bb62631a5dafb525050bffb68de7e.png\"},{\"skillId\":11020,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_69e8d02ef8e1ae83895754e670f63e2e.png\"},{\"skillId\":11010,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b94bb62631a5dafb525050bffb68de7e.png\"},{\"skillId\":11030,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ee7ae2c3b2074399fa3cdb5e5271630e.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"Use 1st Skill to poke, then 2nd Skill to refresh its CD, and 1st Skill on the same enemy again to cause Terrify.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":11010,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b94bb62631a5dafb525050bffb68de7e.png\"},{\"skillId\":11020,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_69e8d02ef8e1ae83895754e670f63e2e.png\"},{\"skillId\":11020,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_69e8d02ef8e1ae83895754e670f63e2e.png\"},{\"skillId\":11010,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b94bb62631a5dafb525050bffb68de7e.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Valentina build, counter, and strategy guide for Mobile Legends. Learn her Enchanted Talisman plus Glowing Wand spike, draft rules, flex items, and ult timing.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Valentina is not a blind-pick mage anymore. She is a draft tax on teams that bring one great ultimate and one fragile mid lane. When the enemy gives her both, she dictates the fight shape before Lord even spawns.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"valentina\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-05-13\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"mid-default-sustained\",\"name\":\"Mid Lane Default\",\"roleContext\":\"Mid\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\",\"cost\":700,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"enchanted-talisman\",\"name\":\"Enchanted Talisman\",\"cost\":2070,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"glowing-wand\",\"name\":\"Glowing Wand\",\"cost\":2050,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"blood-wings\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\",\"cost\":2100,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"divine-glaive\",\"name\":\"Divine Glaive\",\"cost\":1970,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"wishing-lantern\",\"name\":\"Wishing Lantern\",\"cost\":2250,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"enchanted-talisman\",\"name\":\"Enchanted Talisman\"},{\"slug\":\"glowing-wand\",\"name\":\"Glowing Wand\"},{\"slug\":\"blood-wings\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"mage\",\"name\":\"Mage Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"rupture\",\"name\":\"Rupture\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/rupture.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"wilderness-blessing\",\"name\":\"Wilderness Blessing\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/wilderness-blessing.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"impure-rage\",\"name\":\"Impure Rage\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/impure-rage.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"flicker\",\"name\":\"Flicker\"},\"blessing\":null,\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"magic-boots\",\"name\":\"Magic Boots\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when the enemy draft lacks reliable chain CC and you need the fastest early cooldown curve.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"winter-crown\",\"name\":\"Winter Crown\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"wishing-lantern\",\"name\":\"Wishing Lantern\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when a diver can force you after you steal an engage ultimate.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"holy-crystal\",\"name\":\"Holy Crystal\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"blood-wings\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when your front line is stable and the game is decided by raw spell damage instead of shield safety.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default ranked setup that gives Valentina cooldown, burn pressure, late penetration, and enough shield value to hold a stolen ultimate for the real fight.\",\"totalCost\":11140,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"magicpower\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPower\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":360,\"sources\":[\"Enchanted Talisman\",\"Glowing Wand\",\"Blood Wings\",\"Divine Glaive\",\"Wishing Lantern\"]},{\"key\":\"magicpen\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPenetration\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Divine Glaive\"]},{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":600,\"sources\":[\"Enchanted Talisman\",\"Glowing Wand\"]},{\"key\":\"magicdefense\",\"